ELOPMENT_DIAGNOSTIC_ONLY","structural_and_derived_feature_presence":[{"item":"episode_elapsed_time_at_t","note":"Not a temporal channel, not a static, not in the flat feature map. Only grid_index (cutoff ordinal) exists in the raw row, and it is not fed to the model either. Lawfully derivable as (prediction_time - intime).","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"prediction_grid_index","note":"Present in raw rows (used for slicing/governance) but never added to the XGB flat vector or the GRU structured input.","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"time_since_icu_like_episode_start","note":"Same as episode_elapsed_time_at_t; absent.","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"current_sofa","note":"configs/synthetic/feature_schema_v2.json sofa_feature.included=false, reason='RECOVERY_TARGET_SOURCE_IS_NOT_AUTOMATICALLY_A_MODEL_FEATURE'. baseline_sofa exists in the pre-split scientific package (lawful: computed at/before t) but is never joined into the model feature vector.","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"recent_sofa_trajectory","note":"No past-SOFA channel of any kind is fed to the model.","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"current_support_state","note":"vasopressor_on / invasive_ventilation_on are 2 of the 21 temporal channels (LATEST/STATE_AT_BIN_END per 6h bin), so the state at each of the 8 bins IS available.","present_in_model_input":true},{"item":"prior_support_transitions","note":"No derived duration-in-state / transition-count feature; only the raw per-bin binary state (from which a GRU could in principle learn transitions across its 8-step sequence, but XGBoost sees 8 independent binary flags with no explicit transition-count feature).","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"latest_feature_value","note":"Every one of the 21 temporal channels is a LATEST-aggregation value per bin (block 'value' in the flat map).","present_in_model_input":true},{"item":"6h_12h_24h_48h_delta","note":"No difference/delta feature of any kind is constructed; only the raw per-bin latest value.","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"slope_12_24_48h","note":"Not present.","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"rolling_mean_min_max_std","note":"Not present; only the single LATEST value per bin per channel.","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"observation_count_or_fraction_observed","note":"The per-bin observation_mask block exists (True/False per channel per bin), from which an aggregate count/fraction COULD be derived, but no such aggregate is itself supplied as a feature.","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"time_since_last_observation_tslo","note":"The flat map's 'tslo' block supplies TSLO (hours) per channel per bin directly (sentinel 54.0 when never observed in-window). This is the one derived-style signal already present.","present_in_model_input":true},{"item":"missingness_pattern_summaries","note":"Per-bin per-channel observation_mask + tslo exist, but no cross-bin/cross-channel missingness-pattern summary (e.g. total observed count, longest gap) is constructed.","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"historical_extrema","note":"Not present.","present_in_model_input":false},{"item":"recent_volatility_std","note":"Not present.","present_in_model_input":false}],"summary":{"absent_count":13,"headline_finding":"Current SOFA (baseline_sofa) is NOT a model feature for the recovery task, despite being lawfully known at t and already computed in the pre-split package. Elapsed episode time and cutoff index are also absent from the model input, despite being trivially lawful. No delta/slope/rolling-summary/missingness-pattern features exist; only the single LATEST value, an observation mask, and TSLO are supplied per channel per bin. Current/recent support state IS present per-bin, but no derived duration-in-state or transition-count feature is constructed.","present_count":3}}
